{"id":4022,"date":"2017-08-28T14:53:27","date_gmt":"2017-08-28T18:53:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=4022"},"modified":"2017-08-28T14:53:27","modified_gmt":"2017-08-28T18:53:27","slug":"waterfalls-in-michigan-really","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/28\/waterfalls-in-michigan-really\/","title":{"rendered":"Waterfalls in Michigan &#8211; Really?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy and I were both born and spent our early years in Michigan on the west side of Detroit and then spent our school years in Redford Township where we met in <a href=\"http:\/\/www.redfordu.k12.mi.us\/hs\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">high school<\/a>, got married shortly after we graduated and started a family of our own. \u00a0I&#8217;ll tell you about those early years some other time.<\/p>\n<p>Our vacation travels as a young family consisted of driving on up to the Kalkaska<a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/Kalkaska-Map.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-4026\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/Kalkaska-Map-300x239.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/Kalkaska-Map-300x239.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/Kalkaska-Map-768x611.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/Kalkaska-Map.jpg 679w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a> area of Michigan&#8217;s lower peninsula where my folks had moved after Dad&#8217;s retirement from Ford Motor Company in Dearborn. \u00a0It would always be a &#8220;low budget&#8221; trip. \u00a0We would be able to stay close to home (about 4 hours away), the kids would have some time with Papa and Nana, and Kathy and I might even be able to sneak away for a couple hours alone while we got free baby sitting from my folks. \u00a0All in all, it was a &#8220;win-win&#8221; for all of us. \u00a0We had fun back then.<\/p>\n<p>And although we spent a lot of time up in this neck of the woods, we had no idea there were so many waterfalls in Michigan. \u00a0Workamping here at <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/13\/workamping-at-pere-marquette-rv-park-baldwin-mich\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pere Marquette Oaks RV Resort<\/a> gives us every other week (7 days straight) off so we can do what we want. \u00a0Kathy thought it would be fun to go on up to the U.P. (Upper Peninsula). \u00a0As we researched our potential trip, we found that Michigan boasts being home to nearly 200 waterfalls and <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">all but 2 are located in the UP!<\/span>\u00a0 We had been up to <a href=\"http:\/\/www.michigandnr.com\/parksandtrails\/Details.aspx?id=428&amp;type=SPRK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tahquamenon Falls<\/a> years ago, but we thought that was it. \u00a0Boy were we wrong!<\/p>\n<p>We loosely planned our road trip to take up 3 days time. \u00a0We decided to not take the coach and stay in motels 2 nights so we had more mobility and easier entry to some of the sites where the falls might be located. \u00a0It was a good thing we decided this as many of the sites had small access roads and\/or parking areas with not much turnaround room.<\/p>\n<p>We invited our new friends Chuck and Joanne to come along with<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4023\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4023\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-08.14.26.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-4023\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-08.14.26-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-08.14.26-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-08.14.26-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-08.14.26-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-08.14.26.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4023\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The Fantastic Foursome<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>us and we all had a great time. \u00a0They&#8217;ve retired from the Grand Rapids area and as a family they&#8217;ve done lots of camping over the years and they had some ideas on where we could go and what we could see.<\/p>\n<p>Although we wanted to see LOTS of falls, we knew that time, money, and our &#8220;rear ends&#8221; in the car would tell us that 3 days out would be about all we could handle.<\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s a map showing our 3 day route up and back. \u00a0If you want to see an interactive map where you can zoom and pan for yourself, <a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/Q6Y9uktPsuC2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">click here.<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Besides the numerous falls we saw, and the pasties and smoked fish we ate, there was something we learned that I had no idea existed. \u00a0I knew that folks who lived in the Upper Peninsula were known as &#8220;Yoopers&#8221;, but I had no idea that those of us who were born in or lived in the Lower Peninsula were known as &#8220;Trolls&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>I couldn&#8217;t imagine why I would be called a &#8220;Troll&#8221;, until a Yooper shared with me it&#8217;s because we live &#8220;below the bridge&#8221;! \u00a0Now it all makes perfect sense.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4024\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4024\" style=\"width: 896px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/UP-Trip-Map.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4024\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/UP-Trip-Map.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"896\" height=\"821\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/UP-Trip-Map.jpg 589w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/UP-Trip-Map-300x275.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/UP-Trip-Map-768x704.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 896px) 100vw, 896px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4024\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">&#8220;UP&#8221; Road Trip Map<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Here&#8217;s a slide show of some of the high points of our trip. \u00a0I&#8217;m including a few short videos too.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-4022 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.34.56.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.34.56.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4028\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.34.56.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.34.56-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.34.56-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.34.56-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4028'>\n\t\t\t\tPasties are a popular Yooper staple\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.35.08.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.35.08.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4029\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.35.08.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.35.08-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.35.08-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.35.08-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4029'>\n\t\t\t\tSuzy&#8217;s just over the bridge on St. Route 2 is famous\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.38.13.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.38.13.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4030\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.38.13.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.38.13-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.38.13-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-12.38.13-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4030'>\n\t\t\t\tChuck &#038; Joanne live in the same park as Bill &#038; Suzy in Florida during the winter\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.46.06.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.46.06.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4031\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4031'>\n\t\t\t\tGrand Marais Harbor Plaque\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.47.33.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.47.33.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4032\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.47.33.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.47.33-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.47.33-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.47.33-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4032'>\n\t\t\t\tSalvaged from Lake Superior\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.49.30.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-15.49.30.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4033\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4033'>\n\t\t\t\tInteresting Story\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.06.41.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.06.41.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4034\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.06.41.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.06.41-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.06.41-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.06.41-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4034'>\n\t\t\t\tSable Falls near Grand Marais\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.07.26.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.07.26.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4035\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.07.26.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.07.26-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.07.26-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.07.26-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4035'>\n\t\t\t\tAnother view of Sable Falls\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.10.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.10.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4036\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4036'>\n\t\t\t\tIt&#8217;s amazing to watch\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.44.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.44.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4037\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.44.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.44-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.44-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.10.44-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4037'>\n\t\t\t\tThe Fearsome Foursome\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/2017-08-17-16.21.55.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\