max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4071'>\n\t\t\t\tWe&#8217;re all tired at the end of our 3 day trip\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s the video montage of our UP Falls Tour to go along with some of the pictures in the slide show above.<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/_Fjo4MNvN_c\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>All in all, we had a great time seeing beautiful sites with great friends and looking forward to our next adventure. \u00a0So long for now from your friends &#8220;The Trolls&#8221;.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy and I were both born and spent our early years in Michigan on the west side of Detroit and then spent our school years in Redford Township where we met in high school, got married shortly after we graduated and started a family of our own. \u00a0I&#8217;ll tell you about those early years some &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/28\/waterfalls-in-michigan-really\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Waterfalls in Michigan &#8211; Really?<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[586,677,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707438,554707442,554707445,554707439,554707441,11110,554707440,554707436,554707437,554707444,554707443,554707427,14157,554707435],"class_list":["post-4022","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-food","category-friends","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-chuck","tag-escanaba","tag-grand-marais","tag-joanne","tag-manistique","tag-michigan","tag-munising","tag-pond","tag-road-trip","tag-sault-st-marie","tag-st-ignace","tag-state-park